WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.240
The CTE first creates one row per product category
and month The

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:11.861
outer query then groups by category and creates
month columns So

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:19.405
there are two grain changes Run the query and state
both of them Being

00:00:19.431 --> 00:00:24.786
explicit about intermediate grain is one of the best
protections against accidental double counting
